<item>
            <title>[JGVT-1690] Balance Interface: Retrieve and Check Lower and Upper Operating Limits, Status, GxP level and Life Cycle State</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1690</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;As a User,&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
I want to be able to check whether the balance I&apos;m using is meeting GxP requirements ,&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
so that I can use the balance in a GxP experiment.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Design Notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Calibration Due Date and Verification Due Date fields are Read-Only Date/Time fields.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;See Mock-Ups attached&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Upper and Lower Operating Limit - Biovia Onelab &quot;g (gram)&quot; -&amp;gt; Can display in Signal as &quot;g&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
