                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;A Signals Experiment with
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;one or more hub-connected balances in the Equipment Table (Equipment Class = Balance)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;the hub-connected balance(s) may contain Biovia values for Lower Operating Limit, Upper Operating Limit, Life Cycle State, Status and GxP Level.&#160;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;table template(s) Preparation Sub (with external action)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User has added one or more internal references to items for &apos;GxP CISPro Materials&apos;, &apos;GxP Biovia Samples &apos;or &apos;Signals Inventory&apos; in the Preparations Sub table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; a User triggers the external action on the Preparation Sub table to get weigh measurements&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The System shall show a Dialog Window to the User that displays following items of the selected balance:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Lower Operating Limit (Signals, Interface) = Lower Operating Limit (Biovia Hub)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Upper Operating Limit (Signals, Interface) = Upper Operating Limit (Biovia Hub)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;GxP Level (Signals, Interface) = GxP Level (Biovia Hub)
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Note: Capitalize first letter of Value if not done.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Status (Signals, Interface) = Status (Biovia Hub)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Life Cycle State (Signals, Interface) = Life Cycle State (Biovia Hub)
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Note: Capitalize first letter of Value if not done.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User shall be able to assess whether the Balance parameters are GxP compliant or not:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;GxP Level (Biovia Hub) = &apos;GMP&apos; -&amp;gt; Green Color&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;GxP Level (Biovia Hub) = &apos;Non-GMP&apos; -&amp;gt; Red Color&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Status (Biovia Hub) = &apos;Active&apos; -&amp;gt; Green Color&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Status (Biovia Hub) not equal to &apos;Active&apos; -&amp;gt; Red Color&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Life Cycle State (Biovia Hub) = &apos;Active&apos; -&amp;gt; Green Color&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Life Cycle State not equal to &apos;Active&apos; -&amp;gt; Red Color&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
                    </customfield>
